hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18152","Abdur-Razzaq narrated to us, Mamar narrated to us, from al-Zuhri, from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Thalabah al-Ansari, from Abdullah ibn Zayd al-Ansari, from Mujammi ibn Jariyah who said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: The son of Mary will kill the Dajjal at the gate of Ludd, or beside Ludd."
